# IDs of the p/java ruleset pinned in .github/workflows/40-verify.yml (Q59 option c).
# Not the rule bodies: the Semgrep Rules License v1.0 forbids redistributing those (Q55).
# Whoever bumps SEMGREP_RULES_SHA256 updates this file too, in the same commit, so the
# next rotation's git diff shows which rule IDs were added or removed (not content changes
# within an unchanged ID - that part stays a blind accept, per Q59).
# This stops an honest re-pin from going stale; it is not tamper-resistant against a PR that
# edits this file and the workflow's pinned digest together (Q62 (a)) - that is the job of the
# red floor on .github/** and factory/** plus human review, same as for every other change here.
